>>
Rule 1 (output tensor must have the same shape as the input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 2 (output tensor must have a compatible dtype with the input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2) ∨ (dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∧ dtype_(v_2) = 8) ∨ (dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∧ dtype_(v_2) = 7) ∨ (dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∧ dtype_(v_2) = 10)
